[ti:Daisy Bell]
[ar:Harry Dacre]
[00:00.00]There is a flower within my heart, Daisy, Daisy
[00:03.72]Planted one day by a glancing dart
[00:21.48]Planted by Daisy Bell
[00:24.48]Yet I am longing to share the lot
[00:27.48]Of beautiful Daisy Bell
[00:29.48]Daisy, Daisy, give me your answer do
